    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document registers Hypertext Transfer Protocol (HTTP)
authentication schemes that have been defined in RFCs before the IANA
HTTP Authentication Scheme Registry was established.</t>
    </abstract>
